The Theatre of Blood is a [[raid]] located in [[Ver Sinhaza]]. It is the second raid released to date.

Unlike in [[Tombs of Amascut]], players are not allowed to teleport out of the Theatre of Blood - the only way to escape in the middle of a fight is through an [[escape crystal]], sold by the [[Mysterious Stranger]] outside the raid for {{NoCoins|75000|c}} each. Players who die during the raid will be placed in purgatory. If the room is successfully cleared by the remaining players, those who have died will be reunited with the rest of their team. If the entire team dies, the raid will end and team members will have to reclaim their items from the chest for {{NoCoins|100000|c}}. Dying elsewhere without claiming items from the chest will result in them being lost for good. 

== Requirements ==

* Completion of {{SCP|Quest}}[[Priest in Peril]] to access [[Morytania]]

== Suggested skills ==
For Normal and Hard Mode:

* {{SCP|Attack|90+}}
* {{SCP|Strength|90+}}
* {{SCP|Defence|80+}}
* {{SCP|Hitpoints|95+}}
* {{SCP|Ranged|90+}}
* {{SCP|Magic|94+}} for [[Ice Barrage]]
* {{SCP|Prayer|77+}} for [[Piety]], [[Rigour]], and [[Augury]]
* {{SCP|Agility|70+}}

For Entry Mode:

* 75+{{SCP|Attack|}},{{SCP|Strength|}},{{SCP|Defence|}},{{SCP|Hitpoints|}},{{SCP|Ranged|}},{{SCP|Magic|}}, and {{SCP|Prayer|}}

==Transportation==
There are multiple ways to reach [[Ver Sinhaza]]:
*[[Drakan's medallion]], a reward from [[A Taste of Hope]], instantly teleports players to Ver Sinhaza.
*Players can use an [[Ectophial]] to teleport to the [[Ectofuntus]], then run all the way south or run north and pay 10,000 coins to [[Andras]] before running south.
*Players can use the [[Minigame Teleport]] to go to [[Shades of Mort'ton (minigame)|Shades of Mort'ton]], run south to [[Burgh de Rott]] (can also teleport there immediately with [[Morytania legs 3]]) and use the boat to enter [[Meiyerditch]] and run to the gate between it and Ver Sinhaza.
*Spider Cave Teleport, Run south

