Due to the Scythe's unique interaction with max hit scaling, it is recommended for users bringing a Scythe of vitur to check max hit thresholds for the gear they have available to them. For example, the setup shown with 131 strength bonus, [[Piety]], 118 Strength (99 Strength and +19 from a [[Divine super combat potion]]), and having the Scythe on aggressive gives a max hit of 48, but dropping stats or strength bonus from this decreases your max hit by 3, as the Scythe's scaling is nonlinear.

Common max hit thresholds are 46 (+2 max hits), 48 (+3 max hits), and 50 (+2 max hits).

